## Finite Consequence
Exact sharpening of HYP-3471 on the audited bank:
  every structured dead row -> branch-specific unit-delta minimum E/branch gate
  every random dead row -> branch-specific unit-delta minimum gate,
                       or one both-branch unit-delta row,
                       or a 19-row single-branch cover-delta sidecar packet
The residual is therefore finite and typed; it is not arbitrary loss of the
colored gate-reservoir.  The next proof task is to route the 19-row packet
through HYP-3451 conductance/Menger or HYP-3455 gluing sidecars.
